Dialogue: 10,0:02:08.84,0:02:10.53,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bos, kau memanggilku?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:14.18,0:02:15.90,dialog,,0,0,0,,Yo, Anzel.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:16.06,0:02:17.03,dialog,,0,0,0,,Duduklah.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:17.19,0:02:18.49,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tidak usah.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:18.53,0:02:19.99,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku cuma pengawal.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:20.15,0:02:22.18,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau tetap kaku seperti biasa.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:22.59,0:02:23.28,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya sudahlah.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:24.12,0:02:25.46,dialog,,0,0,0,,Soal orang-orang ini...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:25.91,0:02:28.18,dialog,,0,0,0,,Anak buahmu, 'kan?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:28.47,0:02:31.46,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kemarin mereka dikalahkan oleh seorang bocah.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:31.94,0:02:32.91,dialog,,0,0,0,,Oleh bocah?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:33.09,0:02:35.62,dialog,,0,0,0,,Organisasi tidak butuh sampah seperti mereka.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:35.93,0:02:36.86,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hancurkan mereka.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:37.33,0:02:39.50,dialog,,0,0,0,,Membersihkan orang-orang\Nyang mencoreng nama kita,
Dialogue: 10,0:02:39.68,0:02:41.38,dialog,,0,0,0,,bukankah bagian dari tugas pengawal?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:50.97,0:02:51.97,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku mengerti.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:54.30,0:02:55.78,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lalu, satu orang lagi.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:56.21,0:02:58.44,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hajar juga orang ini sekalian.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:13.12,0:03:16.40,dialog,,0,0,0,,Selama masa pementasan,\Nkami tak bisa bermesraan,
Dialogue: 10,0:03:16.44,0:03:18.06,dialog,,0,0,0,,tapi karena semua sudah selesai,
Dialogue: 10,0:03:18.11,0:03:20.96,dialog,,0,0,0,,akhirnya aku bisa memonopoli Nona sepuasnya!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:21.21,0:03:22.46,dialog,,0,0,0,,Nona!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:22.50,0:03:24.47,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ayo kita bermesraan berdua!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:29.59,0:03:32.81,dialog,,0,0,0,,Nona, pementasan sudah selesai,
Dialogue: 10,0:03:32.86,0:03:34.97,dialog,,0,0,0,,tapi kenapa wanita ini ada di sini?!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:35.02,0:03:36.52,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku juga tidak tahu.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:36.56,0:03:38.99,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dia mengikutiku dari teater.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:40.81,0:03:43.33,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hari ini, jangan pedulikan aku,\Nistirahatlah.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:43.58,0:03:44.97,dialog,,0,0,0,,Selamat tidur, Rinokis.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:45.58,0:03:47.25,dialog,,0,0,0,,Eh? Nona?!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:48.68,0:03:51.33,dialog,,0,0,0,,Nona!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:53.25,0:03:55.12,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau tidak apa-apa?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:55.46,0:03:57.22,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ini sudah biasa.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:01.65,0:04:02.56,dialog,,0,0,0,,Silakan.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:02.61,0:04:03.58,dialog,,0,0,0,,Terima kasih.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:08.71,0:04:11.49,dialog,,0,0,0,,Omong-omong, kenapa kau ke sini?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:11.75,0:04:13.65,dialog,,0,0,0,,Pasti ada alasannya, 'kan?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:14.69,0:04:17.45,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku cuma ingin menanyakan sesuatu.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:17.87,0:04:19.89,dialog,,0,0,0,,Rahasia kekuatanku?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:20.13,0:04:20.81,dialog,,0,0,0,,Daging.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:20.85,0:04:23.02,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau makan daging, kau jadi kuat.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:23.52,0:04:25.86,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bukan itu maksudku.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:26.31,0:04:28.29,dialog,,0,0,0,,Waktu itu kau bilang ke para preman, 'kan?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:29.64,0:04:32.56,dialog,,0,0,0,,Malam hari, dua minggu lagi,\Naku akan mendatangi kalian.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:32.76,0:04:34.57,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bersiaplah dengan baik, ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:35.55,0:04:38.05,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dua minggu yang kau bilang itu\Njatuh besok, 'kan?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:38.37,0:04:40.30,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku penasaran ucapanmu itu\Nsungguhan atau tidak.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:40.45,0:04:43.05,dialog,,0,0,0,,Itu cuma bercanda, kok.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:43.32,0:04:45.56,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bohong. Kau pasti pergi, 'kan?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:45.87,0:04:47.16,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku tidak pergi.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:47.19,0:04:49.43,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bagaimana kalau aku mengadu ke pelayanmu?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:49.94,0:04:51.75,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku pergi. Aku pasti pergi.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:51.79,0:04:53.18,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau menghalangi, tak kuampuni.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:53.62,0:04:55.86,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jangan lakukan hal berbahaya begitu.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:56.25,0:04:57.99,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sengaja melompat ke dalam bahaya
Dialogue: 10,0:04:58.02,0:04:59.94,dialog,,0,0,0,,bukan tindakan yang bijak.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:00.18,0:05:02.98,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sembilan puluh persen orang yang hidup\Ndemi bertarung itu bodoh.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:03.17,0:05:06.57,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lagi pula,\Npilihan bijak tidak cocok untuk kami.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:06.86,0:05:07.82,dialog,,0,0,0,,Benar juga.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:07.87,0:05:09.45,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku sangat paham.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:09.87,0:05:12.42,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau aku memilih jalan hidup yang bijak,
Dialogue: 10,0:05:12.45,0:05:15.36,dialog,,0,0,0,,aku tidak akan jadi aktris\Nyang masa depannya tak jelas.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:16.00,0:05:18.12,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apalagi dalam kasusku.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:18.30,0:05:19.16,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bahkan
Dialogue: 10,0:05:19.19,0:05:23.33,dialog,,0,0,0,,setelah mati dan hidup kembali,\Naku masih ingin bertarung.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:23.63,0:05:26.72,dialog,,0,0,0,,Pasti diriku yang dulu juga begitu.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:27.42,0:05:28.66,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku akan pergi.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:29.45,0:05:30.95,dialog,,0,0,0,,Karena ini hal penting.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:35.55,0:05:37.56,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau begitu, ajak aku juga.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:38.39,0:05:39.86,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sharro, kau juga mau ikut?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:40.10,0:05:41.93,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lagi pula, kau tidak akan kalah, 'kan?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:42.61,0:05:44.87,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau begitu, aku boleh ikut, 'kan?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:46.16,0:05:48.10,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku tidak bisa mengajakmu ke sana,
Dialogue: 10,0:05:48.37,0:05:50.70,dialog,,0,0,0,,tapi kalau cuma melihat dari jauh, boleh.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:50.87,0:05:53.12,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tidak ada tawar-menawar lagi.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:00.58,0:06:02.66,dialog,,0,0,0,,Nia, terima kasih atas bantuanmu.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:03.08,0:06:04.97,dialog,,0,0,0,,Pementasannya sangat sukses.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:05.13,0:06:07.13,dialog,,0,0,0,,Berkatmu, Sharro bisa tampil.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:07.31,0:06:08.37,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kami berterima kasih.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:09.38,0:06:10.69,dialog,,0,0,0,,Terima kasih banyak.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:13.49,0:06:14.64,dialog,,0,0,0,,Omong-omong,
Dialogue: 10,0:06:14.99,0:06:16.45,dialog,,0,0,0,,kenapa Sharro ada di sini?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:16.50,0:06:17.89,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sudah, sudah! Jangan dipikir!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:21.10,0:06:22.37,dialog,,0,0,0,,Terima kasih banyak.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:22.85,0:06:24.29,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dengan ini, tugasmu selesai.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:24.52,0:06:26.16,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku akan senang kalau kelak
Dialogue: 10,0:06:26.48,0:06:28.58,dialog,,0,0,0,,bisa bekerja sama denganmu lagi.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:30.02,0:06:33.14,dialog,,0,0,0,,Nia! Sampai jumpa! Sehat selalu!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:33.75,0:06:36.00,dialog,,0,0,0,,Padahal kita bakal bertemu lagi malam ini.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:36.57,0:06:37.52,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aduh.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:37.56,0:06:40.80,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lega rasanya wanita itu tidak ikut lagi!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:41.17,0:06:43.68,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ayo, sekarang waktunya bertemu keluarga Anda!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:43.72,0:06:44.74,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ayo, cepat!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:46.22,0:06:47.08,dialog,,0,0,0,,Nona?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:47.37,0:06:48.75,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ah, maaf.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:48.93,0:06:51.31,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ada barangku yang tertinggal, tunggu di sini.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:51.47,0:06:52.93,dialog,,0,0,0,,Barang apa yang tertinggal?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:53.83,0:06:55.31,dialog,,0,0,0,,Eng, dompet?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:55.48,0:06:58.61,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dari awal Anda tidak punya dompet.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:59.37,0:07:01.56,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau begitu, saputangan?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:01.73,0:07:03.56,dialog,,0,0,0,,Itu juga saya yang bawa.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:06.50,0:07:09.19,dialog,,0,0,0,,Anda sedang merencanakan sesuatu?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:11.19,0:07:13.19,dialog,,0,0,0,,Peka sedikit, dong. Aku mau ke toilet.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:13.62,0:07:15.12,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ah, begitu.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:15.17,0:07:16.47,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau begitu, saya temani.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:16.50,0:07:18.12,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sudah kubilang, aku tidak mau.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:18.16,0:07:20.20,dialog,,0,0,0,,Biarkan aku ke toilet sendiri!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:26.11,0:07:29.06,dialog,,0,0,0,,Pertama, aku harus mencari\Nmarkas mereka secepatnya.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:29.10,0:07:31.22,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sebelum Rinokis datang mengecek.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:38.52,0:07:39.81,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bisa bicara sebentar?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:39.98,0:07:40.77,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hah?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:41.10,0:07:42.98,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bisa beri tahu aku tentang ini?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:43.41,0:07:45.06,dialog,,0,0,0,,Waktuku juga tidak banyak.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:45.24,0:07:47.75,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau lambat, aku bakal kasar.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:55.00,0:07:57.11,dialog,,0,0,0,,Cepat berikan informasinya
Dialogue: 10,0:07:57.14,0:07:58.87,dialog,,0,0,0,,atau kupatahkan tangan dan kakimu.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:09.10,0:08:10.00,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ayo pergi.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:10.16,0:08:12.50,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kita bisa terlambat bertemu ayahku.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:12.77,0:08:13.92,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ah, baik.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:36.70,0:08:39.28,dialog,,0,0,0,,Nia, aktingmu luar biasa!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:39.53,0:08:41.78,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hildetora juga kagum padamu.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:42.19,0:08:43.80,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hildetora?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:44.04,0:08:46.94,dialog,,0,0,0,,Putri ketiga Kerajaan Altoire.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:47.29,0:08:49.91,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dia bilang ingin bertemu langsung denganmu!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:50.32,0:08:51.75,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dengan tanggapan sebaik ini,
Dialogue: 10,0:08:51.79,0:08:54.09,dialog,,0,0,0,,tawaran pekerjaan sebagai aktris\Npasti bertambah.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:54.12,0:08:56.34,dialog,,0,0,0,,Astaga, kau terburu-buru sekali.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:57.37,0:08:59.15,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sebagai putri keluarga Liston,
Dialogue: 10,0:08:59.20,0:09:02.42,dialog,,0,0,0,,aku lega bisa menyelesaikan tugas.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:02.83,0:09:05.32,dialog,,0,0,0,,Terima kasih sudah datang menonton.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:06.79,0:09:09.12,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ayo! Hari ini, kita rayakan!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:09.30,0:09:10.95,dialog,,0,0,0,,Makanlah makanan kesukaanmu.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:18.00,0:09:19.91,dialog,,0,0,0,,Selamat malam, Nona.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:20.41,0:09:22.10,dialog,,0,0,0,,Selamat malam, Rinokis.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:35.54,0:09:38.47,dialog,,0,0,0,,Katanya markas mereka di sini.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:38.50,0:09:40.35,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau begitu, di sebelah sana.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:40.62,0:09:43.35,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi, daerah ini sangat berbahaya.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:50.96,0:09:51.94,dialog,,0,0,0,,Di sana, ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:52.48,0:09:54.37,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sharro, kau sampai di sini saja.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:54.87,0:09:56.46,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sembunyi di sana dan perhatikan.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:57.53,0:09:58.24,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:58.40,0:10:00.39,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hati-hati, Nia.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:31.77,0:10:33.61,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dia benar-benar datang.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:46.34,0:10:47.25,dialog,,0,0,0,,Pelayan?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:48.02,0:10:48.92,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku pengawal.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:51.44,0:10:53.64,dialog,,0,0,0,,Pelayan dan pengawal itu beda, ya?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:56.61,0:10:59.00,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau mengejar Nia?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:59.17,0:10:59.95,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:00.21,0:11:03.27,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sebagai pengawal pribadi,
Dialogue: 10,0:11:03.88,0:11:05.54,dialog,,0,0,0,,aku tidak boleh lengah mengawasinya.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:13.30,0:11:15.25,dialog,,0,0,0,,Situasi apa ini sebenarnya?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:15.80,0:11:19.77,dialog,,0,0,0,,Padahal aku datang dengan niat\Nmeladeni balas dendam mereka.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:20.21,0:11:21.98,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sudah jelas, 'kan?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:25.27,0:11:27.62,dialog,,0,0,0,,Orang yang kalah oleh bocah begini
Dialogue: 10,0:11:27.65,0:11:29.66,dialog,,0,0,0,,tidak kami butuhkan di kelompok kami.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:30.87,0:11:32.72,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau mafia sungguhan?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:33.01,0:11:34.48,dialog,,0,0,0,,Yah, kira-kira begitu.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:35.50,0:11:38.02,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau tidak takut dalam situasi begini?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:40.63,0:11:41.82,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau kuat juga, ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:42.63,0:11:45.58,dialog,,0,0,0,,Pantas saja orang-orang ini kalah.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:46.29,0:11:47.85,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalian beruntung.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:47.88,0:11:50.41,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau bocah ini tidak datang,\Nkalian sudah mati.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:50.86,0:11:51.87,dialog,,0,0,0,,Pergi sana.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:00.08,0:12:02.33,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lalu, kau mau apa?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:02.85,0:12:04.33,dialog,,0,0,0,,Maksudmu?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:04.63,0:12:05.62,dialog,,0,0,0,,Maksudku,
Dialogue: 10,0:12:05.78,0:12:08.53,dialog,,0,0,0,,kau sudah mencoreng nama kami.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:08.58,0:12:10.33,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jadi aku harus bertanggung jawab?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:10.37,0:12:11.84,dialog,,0,0,0,,Maksudmu begitu?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:12.00,0:12:13.35,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tepat sekali.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:13.38,0:12:14.83,dialog,,0,0,0,,Anak yang cerdas.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:15.21,0:12:17.72,dialog,,0,0,0,,Pantas saja kau berani\Ndatang ke sini sendirian.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:18.21,0:12:19.59,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku kesal sekali.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:19.62,0:12:21.41,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sungguh membuatku kesal.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:21.46,0:12:25.23,dialog,,0,0,0,,Padahal aku sudah bersiap\Nmengamuk melawan seratus orang.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:26.00,0:12:28.62,dialog,,0,0,0,,Utang yang seharusnya mereka bayar padaku,
Dialogue: 10,0:12:28.65,0:12:30.65,dialog,,0,0,0,,akan kau bayar.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:31.25,0:12:33.27,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku akan menghajarmu habis-habisan.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:33.80,0:12:36.24,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tidak akan kuampuni sampai\Nkau menangis dan minta maaf!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:36.59,0:12:37.46,dialog,,0,0,0,,Oh, ya?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:37.88,0:12:41.74,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tadinya aku ingin memaafkanmu\Nsetelah membuatmu sedikit menangis.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:45.08,0:12:46.61,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kubunuh kau.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:50.32,0:12:52.62,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tanpa ragu sejak serangan pertama.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:52.66,0:12:53.87,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bolehlah.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:06.85,0:13:09.47,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kenapa kau tertawa?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:09.63,0:13:10.46,dialog,,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:11.36,0:13:13.14,dialog,,0,0,0,,Karena tidak mempan sama sekali?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:14.63,0:13:16.14,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ini aneh!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:16.32,0:13:19.23,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku merasa pukulanku mendarat dengan mantap.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:19.39,0:13:20.89,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kenapa kau tidak bergeming?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:21.07,0:13:22.95,dialog,,0,0,0,,Karena kau lemah, 'kan?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:23.12,0:13:26.29,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bahkan tidak bisa mementalkan\Nseorang anak kecil.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:26.58,0:13:27.47,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:28.15,0:13:28.90,dialog,,0,0,0,,Menurutku,
Dialogue: 10,0:13:29.17,0:13:32.30,dialog,,0,0,0,,menahan serangan si lemah lalu menundukkannya
Dialogue: 10,0:13:32.35,0:13:34.53,dialog,,0,0,0,,adalah tugas orang yang kuat.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:35.16,0:13:36.74,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sok hebat kau.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:37.34,0:13:39.41,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku benar-benar akan membunuhmu!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:42.67,0:13:44.11,dialog,,0,0,0,,Eh? Apa itu?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:45.17,0:13:47.05,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mati kau, bocah sialan!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:47.62,0:13:49.77,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kukira pedang sihir legendaris,
Dialogue: 10,0:13:49.82,0:13:51.62,dialog,,0,0,0,,ternyata cuma batang besi.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:15.50,0:14:18.10,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hei, apa aku lemah?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:18.25,0:14:20.58,dialog,,0,0,0,,Eh? Dia tanya padaku?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:23.84,0:14:27.17,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jujur saja, aku tidak begitu tahu.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:27.38,0:14:29.22,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apakah cuma aku yang terlalu kuat
Dialogue: 10,0:14:29.25,0:14:31.95,dialog,,0,0,0,,atau aku kuat dan kau lemah.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:32.22,0:14:33.55,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi bagaimanapun,
Dialogue: 10,0:14:33.73,0:14:36.26,dialog,,0,0,0,,kalah dariku bukanlah hal yang memalukan.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:41.75,0:14:43.61,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku akan melatihmu sedikit.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:43.77,0:14:45.24,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ayo, serang aku!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:54.62,0:14:55.40,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lo?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:56.00,0:14:57.97,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hei, bukankah ini berbahaya?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:58.25,0:14:59.50,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kasihan sekali.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:59.53,0:15:01.10,dialog,,0,0,0,,Preman jalanan seperti mereka,
Dialogue: 10,0:15:01.13,0:15:03.71,dialog,,0,0,0,,seratus orang pun tidak akan bisa\Nmenghentikan Nona.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:12.86,0:15:14.26,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bunuh saja aku.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:14.44,0:15:17.53,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku sempat khawatir\Nkau tidak tahu kapan harus menyerah.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:18.02,0:15:20.64,dialog,,0,0,0,,Total 38 pukulan, kerja bagus.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:21.17,0:15:23.05,dialog,,0,0,0,,Nah, aku mau pulang.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:25.03,0:15:27.40,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jangan kira ini sudah selesai.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:28.74,0:15:29.55,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau begitu,
Dialogue: 10,0:15:29.60,0:15:32.87,dialog,,0,0,0,,saat aku datang ke ibu kota,\Naku akan mampir ke kedai ini lagi.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:33.40,0:15:35.09,dialog,,0,0,0,,Nanti kita bermain lagi, ya?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:35.75,0:15:36.83,dialog,,0,0,0,,Janji, ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:38.25,0:15:40.17,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau aneh sekali.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:41.10,0:15:42.27,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lalu,
Dialogue: 10,0:15:42.32,0:15:45.17,dialog,,0,0,0,,sebaiknya kau jangan keluar kedai\Nuntuk sementara waktu.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:54.85,0:15:57.01,dialog,,0,0,0,,Maaf membuatmu menunggu.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:57.05,0:15:58.39,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hei, bocah sialan!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:58.87,0:16:00.17,dialog,,0,0,0,,Di mana Anzel?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:00.76,0:16:02.10,dialog,,0,0,0,,Di-Dia orangnya!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:02.13,0:16:04.19,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bocah berambut putih yang sangat kuat!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:05.82,0:16:07.96,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bicaranya sudah cukup, 'kan?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:08.00,0:16:09.70,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ayo cepat mulai!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:39.64,0:16:40.94,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ayo, ayo!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:42.04,0:16:44.94,dialog,,0,0,0,,Cepat pasang kuda-kuda atau kubantai kalian!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:49.32,0:16:50.50,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hei, di sebelah sana!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:55.84,0:16:58.37,dialog,,0,0,0,,Meninju tanpa rasa bersalah
Dialogue: 10,0:16:58.41,0:17:00.53,dialog,,0,0,0,,terasa sangat menyenangkan!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:01.37,0:17:03.51,dialog,,0,0,0,,Anu, apa tidak usah dihentikan?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:04.04,0:17:06.30,dialog,,0,0,0,,Melihatnya bersenang-senang begitu,
Dialogue: 10,0:17:06.34,0:17:08.38,dialog,,0,0,0,,aku jadi tidak tega menghentikannya.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:08.58,0:17:10.74,dialog,,0,0,0,,Begitu, ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:11.03,0:17:12.25,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lagi pula, kalau sudah begini,
Dialogue: 10,0:17:12.64,0:17:14.89,dialog,,0,0,0,,dia tidak akan bisa dihentikan lagi.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:15.66,0:17:17.51,dialog,,0,0,0,,Karena dia jauh lebih kuat dariku.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:20.66,0:17:22.01,dialog,,0,0,0,,Benar, 'kan? Eh?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:22.66,0:17:23.42,dialog,,0,0,0,,Masa, sih?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:23.46,0:17:24.77,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lucu banget!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:29.74,0:17:31.26,dialog,,0,0,0,,Si Anzel itu
Dialogue: 10,0:17:31.30,0:17:33.51,dialog,,0,0,0,,mengamuk lebih parah daripada dugaanku.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:43.49,0:17:46.17,dialog,,0,0,0,,Wah, masih ada tambahan?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:47.38,0:17:49.06,dialog,,0,0,0,,Nia Liston.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:51.33,0:17:52.68,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tunggu sebentar,
Dialogue: 10,0:17:52.72,0:17:54.00,dialog,,0,0,0,,di mana Anzel?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:54.04,0:17:54.93,dialog,,0,0,0,,Anzel?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:55.68,0:17:57.85,dialog,,0,0,0,,Orang itu suruhanmu?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:58.13,0:18:00.22,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dia tergeletak di kedai sana.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:02.09,0:18:04.09,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau mau mengirim pembunuh,
Dialogue: 10,0:18:04.14,0:18:07.14,dialog,,0,0,0,,kirimlah orang yang lebih kuat, ya?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:09.11,0:18:10.60,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bos, bagaimana ini?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:10.77,0:18:12.68,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku tidak paham,
Dialogue: 10,0:18:12.72,0:18:14.06,dialog,,0,0,0,,tapi kita harus menangkapnya, 'kan?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:16.16,0:18:18.57,dialog,,0,0,0,,Oke, tangkap bocah itu!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:18.78,0:18:20.39,dialog,,0,0,0,,Nona Manis,
Dialogue: 10,0:18:20.43,0:18:21.70,dialog,,0,0,0,,jangan melawan dan ikut ka...
Dialogue: 10,0:18:23.42,0:18:25.08,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hei, apa yang kau lakukan?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:25.25,0:18:26.67,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau kebanyakan minum, ya?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:33.68,0:18:35.22,dialog,,0,0,0,,He-Hei! Tunggu!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:36.60,0:18:37.29,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hei.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:38.80,0:18:40.36,dialog,,0,0,0,,Malam ini menyenangkan, ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:40.66,0:18:43.59,dialog,,0,0,0,,Karena suasana hatiku sedang bagus,\Naku bisa saja melepaskan kalian.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:43.97,0:18:44.96,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bagaimana?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:45.46,0:18:48.84,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi rahasiakan keberadaanku di sini.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:49.85,0:18:52.52,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalian bisa berjanji, 'kan?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:59.20,0:19:01.03,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dia memang bilang kalau dirinya kuat,
Dialogue: 10,0:19:01.20,0:19:02.58,dialog,,0,0,0,,tapi sampai sekuat ini?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:03.06,0:19:04.77,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku mau kembali ke hotel dulu.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:05.05,0:19:07.00,dialog,,0,0,0,,Anggap saja aku tidak datang.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:07.46,0:19:08.38,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kenapa?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:08.94,0:19:12.11,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau dia tahu aku membuntutinya,
Dialogue: 10,0:19:12.16,0:19:14.10,dialog,,0,0,0,,lain kali aku tak bisa tahu\Nsaat dia kabur lagi.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:15.41,0:19:17.00,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tugasmu berat juga.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:17.22,0:19:18.50,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sangat berat.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:20.81,0:19:23.32,dialog,,0,0,0,,Padahal aku ini pengawal
Dialogue: 10,0:19:23.74,0:19:25.09,dialog,,0,0,0,,yang bertugas melindunginya.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:26.69,0:19:27.73,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku permisi dulu.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:38.67,0:19:39.99,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ini oleh-oleh untukmu.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:40.02,0:19:41.02,dialog,,0,0,0,,Terima kasih.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:41.61,0:19:43.65,dialog,,0,0,0,,Teh ini enak sekali.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:44.45,0:19:46.66,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jangan lupa ajak pengawalmu
Dialogue: 10,0:19:46.70,0:19:47.98,dialog,,0,0,0,,minum bareng, ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:06.07,0:20:07.78,dialog,,0,0,0,,Saya buatkan teh, ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:10.05,0:20:11.86,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sudah setahun, ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:12.28,0:20:13.30,dialog,,0,0,0,,Setahun?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:13.81,0:20:16.90,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sejak malam Nona hampir mati,
Dialogue: 10,0:20:16.94,0:20:18.22,dialog,,0,0,0,,sudah setahun berlalu.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:19.47,0:20:20.40,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ah.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:22.57,0:20:24.57,dialog,,0,0,0,,Benar juga.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:25.68,0:20:27.22,dialog,,0,0,0,,Setahun sejak malam itu.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:27.66,0:20:29.32,dialog,,0,0,0,,Terasa sangat lama,
Dialogue: 10,0:20:29.50,0:20:31.25,dialog,,0,0,0,,tapi juga terasa cepat.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:34.81,0:20:37.23,dialog,,0,0,0,,Nona, saya punya permintaan.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:37.47,0:20:38.29,dialog,,0,0,0,,Permintaan?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:38.72,0:20:40.91,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mau minta tidur seranjang lagi?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:41.08,0:20:42.65,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tentu saja!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:42.69,0:20:45.76,dialog,,0,0,0,,Anda mau tidur bersama wanita\Nyang baru Anda kenal kemarin,
Dialogue: 10,0:20:45.80,0:20:47.90,dialog,,0,0,0,,tapi kenapa tidak mau tidur dengan saya?!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:47.94,0:20:49.34,dialog,,0,0,0,,Saya sungguh tidak mengerti!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:49.51,0:20:51.64,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau bersamamu, aku tidak mau.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:51.68,0:20:54.10,dialog,,0,0,0,,Nanti kau menciumku saat tidur.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:54.31,0:20:55.64,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tidak apa-apa, 'kan?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:55.68,0:20:57.90,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kita kan sesama wanita!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:57.94,0:20:59.34,dialog,,0,0,0,,Justru karena sesama wanita!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:59.39,0:21:02.27,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa pun yang terjadi,\Ndianggap tidak pernah terjadi!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:03.57,0:21:06.38,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ah, bukan. Permintaan saya bukan itu.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:18.48,0:21:19.50,dialog,,0,0,0,,Nona.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:25.00,0:21:27.32,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tolong latih saya bertarung.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:28.24,0:21:30.01,dialog,,0,0,0,,Latihan bertarung seperti apa?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:30.19,0:21:32.01,dialog,,0,0,0,,Latihan pertarungan sesungguhnya.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:32.58,0:21:34.73,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau saya jauh lebih lemah daripada Anda,
Dialogue: 10,0:21:34.90,0:21:37.61,dialog,,0,0,0,,tidak ada gunanya saya mengawal Anda.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:38.45,0:21:40.77,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau yakin?\NAku tidak akan bersikap lembut.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:41.41,0:21:42.79,dialog,,0,0,0,,Saya sudah siap.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:43.32,0:21:44.68,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jika terus seperti ini,
Dialogue: 10,0:21:44.72,0:21:47.78,dialog,,0,0,0,,saya bahkan tidak akan bisa menyamai Anda.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:49.70,0:21:51.38,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau begitu, Rinokis.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:52.28,0:21:55.03,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mulai sekarang, kau murid pertamaku.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:55.46,0:21:59.00,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jadilah kuat agar tidak membuatku malu.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:59.63,0:22:02.18,dialog,,0,0,0,,Saya akan mengabdikan seluruh jiwa dan raga.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:42.46,0:23:44.35,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ayo berangkat, Nona.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:44.52,0:23:45.32,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:45.95,0:23:47.99,dialog,,0,0,0,,Saatnya memulai kehidupan akademi!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:55.89,0:23:58.54,dialog,,0,0,0,,Selanjutnya, "Pertemuan Para Gadis".
